### Create an S3 bucket using 
AWS Console:
- S3 stands for Simple storage service
- storage repository for objects or files
- S3 bucket name should be globally unique
- TODO: find out various Use cases to create a new bucket

AWS CLI or cloud shell:
- aws s3api create-bucket --bucket sample-bucket --region us-east-1
- aws s3api list-buckets
- aws s3api list-buckets --query "Buckets[].Name" : to list bucket with only Names
- aws s3 mb s3://bucket-name : to create/make bucket using s3 
- aws s3api create-bucket --bucket sample-bucket2 --region eu-west-1 --create-bucket-configuration LocationConstraint=eu-west-1 : You need to specify the location constraint if you are planning to create a bucket in the region other than current region

Powershell:
- This is used wherever automation needed
